A||||11||86SE||Guess what I beat last night??||||14||
Z||000000||86SE||09-01-2000||11:29 AM||||I hammered a Ford Mustang!  It wasent a GT or anything special, but it had the displacement on me.  Im pretty sure it was a 97 Mustang.  It had the 3.8L V6 and an auto trans.<P>We pulled up nose to nose at a standstill, someone yelled go and we plowed through .65 miles in what felt like seconds!  I dropped it down to first, put the petal to the plastic and pulled away INSTANTLY!  I had a good 1.5 car legnths on him shifting into second gear.  When I hit the end of second at about 80 MPH, he was about 6-8 car legnths back.<BR>I talked to him later and he said thats all his stang had! HAHAHAHAhA  Guess I have the bragging rights now!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I could not beleave it!  Auto vs Auto, V6 vs V6, and a 3.8 vs a 2.8!<P>Long live Fieros!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>'86 Special Edition,<BR>High-Output V-6 Yellow Fiero<BR>Special Rally Heavy Duty Suspention||||reg||14
Z||000001||Haze_Performance||09-01-2000||11:59 AM||||Well I a Mustang owner myself so I have to say.....................................................................Good Kill!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> V6 Mustangs Suck!!!!! Damn Wanabe V8!!!! Waste of car part's!!!!!<P>Sorry... I always felt that Ford should have made V8 Mustangs only. (Mid 80's on up) The V6 isnt worth 2 cents to me. A under 190 h.p. engine in a so called sports car is a joke. The damn Nissan Maxima has 222 h.p. and it runs 15.4 in the 1/4. The Mustang has became a joke of a sports car since 1994.<P><BR>Sorry Im done venting  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycarsig.jpg">  <B>My 1985 2M4 Sport Coupe </B><P><BR><B>My Website's  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/WS6_Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero</A> &                  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/HMP" TARGET=_blank>H.M.P. </A></B>||||reg||14
Z||000002||BBBAD GT||09-01-2000||12:22 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 86SE:<BR><B><P>I could not beleave it!  Auto vs Auto, V6 vs V6, and a 3.8 vs a 2.8!<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You forgot 3400lb vs 2900lb.  Don't take this wrong, I just wanted to point out weight makes a big difference if you want to compare apples to apples.  And I agree with Haze, the V6 Stangs are nothing to me, even though I've seen some Vortech V-6's run 13-14 sec 1/4 mi. But again, I don't see why go to that effort when you coulda had a V8 (pun intended).  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/BBBAD_GT_SIG.gif">    <P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/V8Fiero" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD V8</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A>||||reg||1
