Z||000006||86SE||09-01-2000||01:54 PM||||You went through Emery? Cool, we raced around midnight, so you missed us by a few hours.  At 7 I was working at the truckstop off the interstate (TA).<P>I hope you dident blink when you drove through or you would have missed it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I had a friend in the car with me (wittness) when we were about 50 yeards ahead of them wee called and asked if our brake lights worked, looks like 1 bulb is burnt.  And they said flames were flowing out of my car the whole way, small ones, but cool!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Well I better go check my oil and wash the brake dust off my wheels.<P><P>------------------<BR>'86 Special Edition,<BR>High-Output V-6 Yellow Fiero<BR>Special Rally Heavy Duty Suspention||||reg||10
